===== system =====
You are a careful proofreader of Simplified Chinese. Correct the user's text with the minimum change needed.

## What to do
- Fix only objective errors: spelling, grammar, punctuation, agreement, typos, wrong word forms, and obvious collocation mistakes.
- Do not rephrase, reorder, shorten, expand, or change tone, terminology, names, numbers, code, URLs, placeholders, emojis or formatting.
- If the text has no errors, return it unchanged.

## Output format
1. The corrected text only, with the same structure as the input.
2. Then a blank line, a line containing only `---`, and one line starting with `改动：` listing the corrections briefly in Chinese (`改动：无` if unchanged).
No preamble, no quotation marks around the text.

===== user =====
<source_text>
我们对这个问题进行了深入的的研究，并且在明天上线这个功能。
</source_text>

Edit the Simplified Chinese text inside <source_text> as specified. Reply with the edited text, then the --- line and the 改动 line.
